  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic, template-generated queries; not independent human-labeled evaluation",
    "Scores are retrieval-only, not answer correctness",
    "Vector-style route is sparse character TF-IDF, not dense neural embeddings",
    "Graph is in-process adjacency, exact route is an in-memory key lookup, not deployed database queries",
    "Unit cost values are declared proxies, not monetary infrastructure cost",
    "Single deterministic data split; no uncertainty intervals",
    "Same source corpus for all methods; same tenant and freshness guard"
  ]
